<p>Alweda Aon o Mohammad Alweda Aon o Mohammad<br />
Jao Maidaa'n ko sidhaaro Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

<p>1. Nusrat e shah karo ran ko sidhaaro baccho<br />
Apni Amma se kiya waads nibhao baccho<br />
Jaan mamu pa lutaao - Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

<p>2. Apne nan ki tarah jang fatah kardaalo<br />
ek hi waar me lashkar ko fana kardaalo<br />
nasle baatil to mitaao -Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

<p>3. Aye mere raaj dulaaro ye meri baat suno<br />
mamu Abbas(a.s) ke shagird ho batado inko<br />
jang is tarah dikhao - Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

<p>4. Mere baccho mere pyaaro hai ye hukme maadar<br />
nahr ka rukh bhi na karna ke hai pyaase Asghar(a.s)<br />
Pyaas apni na bujhao - Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

<p>5. Ran ko jana hai tumhe mai ye bata deti hoon<br />
sar kataana hai tumhe apna bata deti hoon<br />
Jaan Asgar(a.s) pa lutaao - Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

<p>6. Mera armaan hai mai tum ko fida kar daalu<br />
Apne bhai pa tumhe aaj fida kar daalu<br />
Mera Armaan nikaalo - Alweda Aon o Mohammad</p>

